\u2014beginner, intermediate, and advanced\u2014ensuring everyone has a chance to grow. These events go beyond just coding; they foster problem-solving, logical thinking, and confidence in a creative, supportive space. Students tackle real-world scenarios, collaborate with peers, and earn valuable rewards for their efforts, all while developing essential skills for the future."}),(0,v.jsx)("p",{children:"The contests also offer amazing prizes like exclusive tech gadgets, scholarships, and certificates from prestigious partners such as IITs, BITS Pilani, and USACO. These prizes not only celebrate students\u2019 hard work but also enhance their learning portfolios, providing a competitive advantage for future academic and career opportunities."})]}),imagePath:"/images/competitions/coding-camp",imageWidth:370,imageHeight:370}),(0,v.jsx)(p.Z,{title:(0,v.jsxs)(v.Fragment,{children:["Our competitions are appropriate for"," ",(0,v.jsx)("span",{className:"yellow-underline",children:"Our competitions are appropriate for"})]}),description:(0,v.jsx)(v.Fragment,{children:(0,v.jsx)("p",{children:"Our coding competitions and hackathons are designed for kids aged 6-18, offering challenges for every grade, from K-12. Whether you\u2019re a high schooler building your resume or an elementary student exploring the basics of coding, there\u2019s something for everyone. Participants can earn certifications, win prizes, and gain recognition from top institutions. These competitions also provide valuable preparation for future competitive exams and offer students the opportunity to showcase their winning projects. Join Codingal\u2019s competitions and hackathons to turn your passion for coding into achievements that highlight your growth, learning, and dedication!"})}),imagePath:"/images/competitions/coding-for-school-kids",imageWidth:370,imageHeight:370}),(0,v.jsx)(b,{})]}),(0,v.jsx)(l.Z,{})]})};G.getInitialProps=function(){var e=(0,i.Z)(s().mark((function e(t){var n,i,r,o,a,l,d,u;return